`fix_svg_relative_paths` parses with `ET.parse(filepath)`, finds elements with tag `{http://www.w3.org/2000/svg}a` or `image`, and attribute `{http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink}href`. So my fake SVG should use those namespaces.

